---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ToolNavigation from '../../components/ToolNavigation.astro';
const tasks=[
 {title:'Think through a decision',text:'Compare options, challenge a plan and carry what you learn into action.',href:'/tools/edge-journey',label:'Decision Explorer + working brief',kind:'A useful starting point'},
 {title:'Say it more clearly',text:'Compare your original message with a suggested version. Keep the meaning in your hands.',href:'/tools/before-you-send',label:'Before You Send',kind:'A focused task'},
 {title:'Practise a conversation',text:'Rehearse a discussion, negotiation or board question, with private preparation and optional coaching.',href:'/tools/edge-practice',label:'Conversation Practice',kind:'A space to rehearse'},
 {title:'Build something worth saying',text:'Connect audience, positioning and evidence to useful content, then learn from the response.',href:'/tools/brand-content',label:'Brand and Content workspace',kind:'A specialist application'},
 {title:'Review an AI use case',text:'Record evidence, unknowns, ownership and next actions, with oversight that fits the situation.',href:'/tools/maturity-assessment',label:'AI Readiness Review',kind:'A specialist application'},
 {title:'Explore an ethical trade-off',text:'Practise reasoning through a fictional AI scenario. Take useful questions back to the real situation.',href:'/tools/ethical-dilemma',label:'Ethical Dilemma',kind:'A learning exercise'}
];
const stages=[['Evaluate','Understand the situation','Separate evidence from assumptions. Explore the options.'],['Define','Choose a direction','Agree the outcome and what matters most.'],['Govern','Make room for action','Clarify accountability and the conditions for progress.'],['Elevate','Apply, improve and learn','Observe what happens and bring the learning forward.']];
---
<BaseLayout title="EDGE toolkit | Clearer thinking, useful action" description="Use EDGE to explore a decision, sharpen a message, practise a conversation or build a useful plan. Four connected stages, with optional tools and human judgement."><link rel="stylesheet" href="/journey/journey.css"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/journey/toolkit.css"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/journey/tool-shell.css"/><div class="shell"><ToolNavigation/>
<header><div class="eyebrow"><img src="/brand/edge-mark-on-navy.svg" width="32" height="32" alt="EDGE"/>Intelligence, put into practice</div><h1>A little clarity.<br/><span>A useful next step<b class="full-stop">.</b></span></h1><div class="intro"><p>Start with what you want to do. EDGE helps you understand a situation, choose a direction, act and learn. Tools support the thinking. You make the decisions.</p><p class="small">A few minutes for a message.<br/>A connected brief for a bigger initiative.</p></div></header>
<main><section aria-labelledby="task-heading" class="toolkit-section"><div class="section-intro"><h2 id="task-heading">What would help today?</h2><p>Start anywhere. Use only what is useful.</p></div><div class="task-grid">{tasks.map(t=><a class="task-card" href={t.href}><span class="eyebrow">{t.kind}</span><h3>{t.title}</h3><p>{t.text}</p><span class="task-link">{t.label} →</span></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="toolkit-section framework" aria-labelledby="framework-heading"><div class="section-intro"><h2 id="framework-heading">One method. Four connected stages.</h2><p>For a full decision, begin with Evaluate. Bring what you learn into the next stage, and revisit earlier thinking when the evidence changes.</p></div><div class="pillar-grid">{stages.map(([name,title,text],i)=><a href={'/tools/edge-journey#'+name.toLowerCase()}><span class="eyebrow">0{i+1} / {name}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></a>)}</div><p class="small">Governance informs the whole process. The Govern stage makes responsibilities and boundaries explicit around the direction you have chosen.</p></section>
<section class="toolkit-section" aria-labelledby="focused-heading"><div class="section-intro"><h2 id="focused-heading">Already know what you need?</h2><p>Focused tools remain available without completing a whole workspace.</p></div><div class="focused-links"><a href="/tools/brand-profile-generator">Brand Profile →</a><a href="/tools/brand-palette">Brand Palette →</a><a href="/tools/content-sprint-generator">Content Planner →</a><a href="/tools/prompt-engineer">Prompt Brief Builder →</a></div></section>
<section class="toolkit-note"><h2>Keep your judgement in the loop.</h2><p>AI suggestions are drafts. Simulations are rehearsal, and a completed brief does not approve an action. Each tool explains how it handles your notes. Use anonymised context and keep evidence separate from assumptions.</p></section></main>
<footer><span>EDGE, created by <a href="https://adrianwatkins.com/edge" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Adrian Watkins ↗</a></span><a href="/">Explore democratising.ai →</a></footer></div></BaseLayout>
